#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:111
msgid ""
"A program called '%1' is slowing down the others on your machine. It may have a "
"bug that is causing this, or it may just be busy.\n"
"Would you like to try to stop the program?"
msgstr ""
"'%1' भनिने कार्यक्रमले तपाईँको मेशिनमा अन्य देखाउदैछ । यसको कारण बग वा यो "
"व्यस्त भएकाले हुन सक्छ ।\n"
"तपाईँ कार्यक्रम रोक्ने प्रयास गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ ?"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:116
msgid "Keep Running"
msgstr "चलाइ राख्नुहोस्"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:122
msgid "In future, should busy programs called '%1' be ignored?"
msgstr "भविष्यमा, '%1' भनिने व्यस्त कार्यक्रम उपेक्षा गर्नुहुन्छ ?"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:124
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "उपेक्षा गर्नुहोस्"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:124
msgid "Do Not Ignore"
msgstr "उपेक्षा नगर्नुहोस्"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:162
msgid "Naughty applet"
msgstr "नराम्रो एप्लेट"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:164
msgid "Runaway process catcher"
msgstr "रनअवे प्रक्रिया क्याचर"

#: NaughtyConfigDialog.cpp:55
